What does `print(seating(false));` print?

```dart
String? plusOne(String name) => name == 'Bo' ? 'Cy' : null;

List<String> seating(bool vip) {
  final guests = ['Ana', 'Bo'];
  return [
    'Host',
    ...guests,
    if (vip) 'Press' else 'Public',
    for (final g in guests) ?plusOne(g),
  ];
}
```

